# Portrait: the library turned upright (a tap on the rotate button), a book read upright, its
# controls, the appearance in one column, a comic page, back to landscape. Taps are on the canvas,
# as the panel reports them: an upright point (x, y) of the 600 x 1024 screen is canvas (y, 599 - x).
wait 60
shot 01_landscape
key 0x12 0x01
wait 60
shot 02_portrait_library
tap 176 505
wait 20
shot 03_portrait_page
key 0x4F
wait 4
shot 04_portrait_next
tap 512 300
wait 3
shot 05_portrait_chrome
key 0x29
wait 3
key 0x04
wait 4
shot 06_portrait_look
key 0x29
wait 3
key 0x29
wait 6
shot 07_portrait_home
key 0x12 0x01
wait 30
shot 08_landscape_again
